// System's Disk panel: how the block map shades each kind of program (1-bit patterns from
// data/patterns.ron, drawn in the theme's ink and paper). Free blocks stay plain paper.
(
    fills: [
        (kind: Breaker, pattern: "crosshatch"),
        (kind: Shield,  pattern: "bricks"),
        (kind: Utility, pattern: "p50"),
    ],
)
